# Edgewall Inn: "{3}, {T}, Sacrifice this land: Return target card that has an Adventure from your graveyard to your hand" (CR 115.1, 602.2, 715.1, 701.21).
# Bot1 plays the Inn on turn 1 and casts Cheeky House-Mouse (a creature card that has the Adventure Squeak By); Bot2 bolts it on turn 2 and casts its
# own Mouse, which Bot1 bolts on turn 3. The Inn then cannot return Bot1's Lightning Bolt (no Adventure) or Bot2's Mouse (not Bot1's graveyard);
# it returns Bot1's Mouse, paid with {3} from three Moxen (pool left empty) and with the Inn itself tapped (refused while it is still tapped on turn 2) and sacrificed.

